<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH C.BANK BILLS GROSS 12.4 PCT, UNDERSUBSCRIBED.</title>
<headline>CZECH C.BANK BILLS GROSS 12.4 PCT, UNDERSUBSCRIBED.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gross yield in a Dutch auction offering five billion crowns in 13-week Czech National Bank liquidity bills was 12.4 percent, and the bill was slightly undersubscribed with bids totalling 4.249 billion crowns, the CNB said.</p>
<p>The yield was unchanged from an auction of similiar bills last week. -- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
